WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,080
You really treat it as a welfare and everyone is taking you with sincerity.

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:05,600
They just see you by my side every day

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:07,600
I want to get gossip out of you

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,000
do you know

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,680
Old lady calm down

6
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:12,680
The food is getting cold

7
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:14,880
You need to have some food to cool down first.

8
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:17,680
It’s not too late to say the rest slowly.

9
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:19,480
Mammy is right

10
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:21,600
It was Yunlan Tanwan who lost his sense of proportion.

11
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:23,200
Made the old lady angry

12
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:25,000
Yunlan will serve you for your meal

13
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,900
You also sit down and eat something

14
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:29,550
Don't just eat

15
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:30,750
Eat more dishes

16
00:00:35,890 --> 00:00:37,950
I don't want to restrain you either

17
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:40,550
It's just that this welfare is unpopular.

18
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:42,750
Every Buddha’s mouth, tongue and heart

19
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:45,750
I really don’t want you to take the same responsibility as Huaining
